{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_8_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_8","textTraditional":"一、八年，春，宋公、衞侯遇於垂。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_8_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_8","textTraditional":"不期而會曰遇。遇者，志相得也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_8_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_8","textTraditional":"二、三月，鄭伯使宛來歸邴。庚寅，我入邴。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_8_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_8","textTraditional":"名宛，所以貶鄭伯，惡與地也。入者，內弗受也。日入，惡入者也。邴者，鄭伯所受天子而祭泰山之邑也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_8_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_8","textTraditional":"三、夏，六月，己亥，蔡侯考父卒。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_8_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_8","textTraditional":"諸侯日卒，正也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_8_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_8","textTraditional":"四、辛亥，宿男卒。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_8_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_8","textTraditional":"宿，微國也，未能同盟，故男卒也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_8_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_8","textTraditional":"五、秋，七月，庚午，宋公、齊侯、衞侯盟於瓦屋。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_8_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_8","textTraditional":"外盟不日，此其日何也？諸侯之參盟於是始，故謹而日之也。誥誓不及五帝，盟詛不及三王，交質子不及二伯。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_8_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_8","textTraditional":"六、八月，葬蔡宣公。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_8_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_8","textTraditional":"月葬，故也。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_8_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_8","textTraditional":"七、九月，辛卯，公及莒人盟於包來。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_8_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_8","textTraditional":"可言公及人，不可言公及大夫。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_8_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_8","textTraditional":"八、螟。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_8_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_8","textTraditional":"九、冬，十有二月，無侅卒。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_8_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_8","textTraditional":"無侅之名，未有聞焉。或曰，隱不爵大夫也。或說曰，故貶之也。","sentenceOrder":17}],"overrides":{}}